efore, you can easily avail them if you need in any scenario. Moreover, in case of small revisions, we do not charge. However, if you want bigger amendments in such a situation, the charges might vary.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/section>\n<section class='av_toggle_section av-kzi1lmsj-25e29c44ba46f9e79615ad8558c49030'  itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemprop=\"mainEntity\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/Question\" ><div role=\"tablist\" class=\"single_toggle\" data-tags=\"{All} \"  ><p data-fake-id='#toggle-id-14' class='toggler   '  itemprop=\"name\"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-14'>Do we deduct money from binding agreements?<span class=\"toggle_icon\"><span class=\"vert_icon\"><\/span><span class=\"hor_icon\"><\/span><\/span><\/p><div id='toggle-id-14' class='toggle_wrap  '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemprop=\"acceptedAnswer\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/Answer\" ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop=\"text\" ><p>No, we do not deduct any money from the binding agreements.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/section>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<div class='flex_column av-fz9pr-ea37c472dd940dd8e502cb94f4fa5aea av_one_full  avia-builder-el-10  el_after_av_one_full  el_before_av_one_full  first flex_column_div column-top-margin'   ><style type=\"text\/css\" id=\"style-css-av-kzi1mtv2-c7795853aca84ace0d28c7c02e5ab8fd\">\n#top .av-special-heading.av-kzi1mtv2-c7795853aca84ace0d28c7c02e5ab8fd{\npadding-bottom:10px;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='av-special-heading av-kzi1mtv2-c7795853aca84ace0d28c7c02e5ab8fd av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote  avia-builder-el-11  avia-builder-el-no-sibling  '><h2 class='av-special-heading-tag '  itemprop=\"headline\"  >Privacy Policy<\/h2><div class='special-heading-border'><div class='special-heading-inner-border'><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" id=\"style-css-av-7n0av-9cc8769fa321217fd0499dcc58a4e894\">\n#top .flex_column.av-7n0av-9cc8769fa321217fd0499dcc58a4e894{\nmargin-top:20px;\